  "Guest mode: progress is not saved when you leave.": "目前使用訪客模式，離開後不會保存進度。",
  "This free, non-profit fan game has no ads or in-game purchases. Pokémon and its characters belong to Nintendo, Creatures and GAME FREAK; this project is not affiliated with them.": "本作是免費、非營利的同人遊戲，沒有廣告或內購。寶可夢及相關角色屬於 Nintendo、Creatures 與 GAME FREAK，本專案與上述公司無關。",
  "Unova": "合眾",
  "A fan of three piercing leaves.": "朝前方射出三片扇形展開的葉子，可穿透敵人。",
  "A quick poisonous sting.": "快速射出帶毒的尖刺。",
  "A wide wing sweep that pushes foes back.": "大幅揮動翅膀，將前方敵人擊退。",
  "A fireball at the nearest enemy.": "向最近的敵人發射火球。",
  "A magical breeze in every direction.": "朝四周吹出妖精之風。",
  "A fan of bubbles that slows whatever they touch.": "以扇形射出泡沫，使碰到的敵人減速。",
  "A permanent electric field around you.": "在周圍持續展開電場。",
  "A slow but devastating water blast.": "發射速度較慢、威力強大的水柱。",
  "A jet of fire that pierces everything in a straight line.": "沿直線噴出火焰，穿透路徑上的所有敵人。",
  "A piercing jet. Reliable at any range.": "發射能穿透敵人的水柱，遠近皆宜。",
  "A quick bite that knocks foes back.": "迅速咬擊敵人並將其擊退。",
  "A lightning-fast bolt that pierces several enemies.": "射出高速電流，可穿透多名敵人。",
  "A flash of light all around you.": "向四周釋放耀眼光芒。",
  "Drains life from everything nearby and heals you with every hit.": "吸取附近敵人的生命，每次命中都能回復體力。",
  "Roots that snare and pound everything near you.": "以根鬚纏住並攻擊附近的敵人。",
  "Charges in an arc at everything in front of you.": "衝向前方，攻擊扇形範圍內的所有敵人。",
  "An energy sphere that never misses.": "發射必定命中目標的能量球。",
  "A shadowy orb that pierces several foes.": "發射能穿透多名敵人的暗影球。",
  "A radial mental burst that seeks enemies.": "向四周釋放會追蹤敵人的念力波。",
  "Explodes in flames in every direction.": "朝四周引爆火焰。",
  "A sharp, powerful blow straight ahead.": "朝正前方使出俐落而強勁的一擊。",
  "Sticky threads in every direction that slow foes a lot.": "向四周吐出黏絲，大幅降低敵人的移動速度。",
  "A ghostly lick that briefly paralyzes.": "用舌頭舔擊敵人，使其短暫麻痺。",
  "Long-range whips in a wide arc.": "揮動藤鞭，橫掃前方大範圍的敵人。",
  "Draconic flames in a straight line.": "沿直線吐出龍之火焰。",
  "Flames that spin around you. Constant defense.": "讓火焰環繞身旁，持續攻擊靠近的敵人。",
  "A rain of rocks all around you.": "讓大量岩石落在周圍。",
  "Toxic sludge that poisons on impact.": "投擲有毒污泥，使命中的敵人中毒。",
  "A quick bite in a short arc.": "迅速咬擊前方小範圍內的敵人。",
  "Deals no damage: builds ATTACK faster than Swords Dance.": "不造成傷害；持續使用可累積攻擊加成，速度比劍舞更快。",
  "Deals no damage: builds ATTACK while active.": "不造成傷害；使用期間持續累積攻擊加成。",
  "Deals no damage: builds DEFENSE while active.": "不造成傷害；使用期間持續累積防禦加成。",
  "Deals no damage: builds health REGENERATION.": "不造成傷害；持續使用可累積體力回復效果。",
  "Deals no damage: builds SPEED while active.": "不造成傷害；使用期間持續累積移動速度加成。",
  "A poisonous cloud around you that intoxicates.": "在身旁釋放毒霧，使附近敵人中毒。",
  "A wave of dark energy in every direction.": "向四周釋放惡屬性能量波。",
  "A wave that homes in on its target.": "發射會追蹤目標的波動。",
  "A sound wave that spreads in every direction.": "向四周發出擴散的聲波。",
  "A heavy boulder that pushes the enemy back.": "投出沉重的岩石，將敵人擊退。",
  "A full-weight tackle: slow, short and brutal.": "以全身重量撞擊敵人。出手較慢、距離較短，但威力強大。",
  "A fast, steady flurry. Low damage, high rate.": "連續發動快速攻擊。單次傷害較低，但攻擊頻率很高。",
  "A piercing beam of metallic light.": "發射能穿透敵人的金屬光束。",
  "An icy beam that almost freezes foes solid.": "發射冰冷光束，大幅降低敵人的移動速度。",
  "A wide, heavy-hitting psychic beam.": "發射寬廣且威力強大的精神光束。",
  "Whirlwinds that escort you.": "讓旋風環繞身旁。",
  "Shakes the ground: damages and slows everything nearby.": "震動地面，對附近所有敵人造成傷害並使其減速。",
  "Splashes mud around and slows foes.": "朝四周潑灑泥巴，使敵人減速。",
