  "The only official PokéSurvivor website is pokesurvivor.com. The game is and always will be free: if anyone asks you to pay, it isn't us.": "原作官方網站為 pokesurvivor.com。遊戲免費提供；其他網站若要求付費，與原作者無關。",
  "Code license: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 (you may use, study and modify it, but not to make money). Versions up to 14-10-2026 remain under MIT.": "程式採 PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 授權，可使用、研究與修改，但不得用於營利。2026 年 10 月 14 日以前的版本保留原 MIT 授權。",
  "Official website: pokesurvivor.com · if anyone asks you to pay, it isn't us": "原作官方網站：pokesurvivor.com · 原作者不會要求你為遊戲付費",
  "PokéSurvivor has no official cryptocurrency, token or NFT, and its author has not created any. Any token using the game's name was created by third parties: we take no responsibility for any purchase, sale or investment you make with them, and nothing here is investment advice.": "PokéSurvivor 沒有官方加密貨幣、代幣或 NFT，原作者也未發行任何相關項目。以遊戲名稱發行的代幣均來自第三方；原作者不對相關交易或投資負責，本專案也不提供投資建議。",
