  "Survive the hordes with your partner Pokémon · free, on PC and mobile": "與寶可夢夥伴一起迎戰大軍 · 電腦與手機皆可免費遊玩",
  "A Pokémon survival game, free in your browser and on mobile.": "免費的寶可夢生存遊戲，打開瀏覽器就能玩。",
