  "Your game is saved in the cloud: log in from any computer. Guest progress is not saved.": "登入帳號後可在不同裝置接續遊玩。訪客模式不會保存進度。",
  "Opened from a file: your game is only saved in this browser. To save in the cloud, play the online version.": "目前從本機檔案開啟，進度只會存在這個瀏覽器。若要跨裝置遊玩，請使用網站版本。",
  "Couldn't connect to the cloud: your game is only saved in this browser.": "無法連上伺服器，進度暫存於這個瀏覽器。",
  "Cloud not configured: your game is only saved in this browser.": "尚未設定雲端存檔，進度只會存在這個瀏覽器。",
  "This browser won't let us save data: play as a guest.": "瀏覽器無法儲存資料，請先以訪客身分遊玩。",
