  "No internet connection.": "目前沒有網路連線。",
  "The browser blocked the Google window. Please allow pop-ups.": "瀏覽器封鎖了 Google 登入視窗，請允許彈出視窗後再試。",
  "This domain is not authorized in Firebase (Authentication > Settings > Authorized domains).": "網站網址未獲登入服務授權，請聯絡管理者。",
  "Google sign-in needs the online version of the game.": "請使用網站版本進行 Google 登入。",
