  "Rotate your phone": "請旋轉裝置",
  "PokéSurvivor is played in landscape.": "請將裝置轉成橫向遊玩 PokéSurvivor。",
  "The game couldn't fully load (did the connection drop?).": "部分遊戲資料載入失敗，請檢查網路後重新載入。",
  "Reload": "重新載入",
  "Fan project": "同人專案",
  "is a game made by fans,": "是由玩家製作的同人遊戲，",
  ". It has no ads, no purchases and no source of income of any kind, and it never will.": "。遊戲沒有廣告、內購或其他營利項目，未來也不會加入。",
  "It is not affiliated with, sponsored or endorsed by Nintendo, Creatures Inc., GAME FREAK or The Pokémon Company. Pokémon and all related names and characters are trademarks and property of their respective owners.": "本專案未獲 Nintendo、Creatures Inc.、GAME FREAK 或 The Pokémon Company 授權、贊助或認可，亦不隸屬上述公司。寶可夢及相關名稱、角色與商標均屬於各自的權利人。",
  "Third-party content": "第三方素材",
  "Sprites from": "角色圖像來自",
  "(CC BY-NC 4.0, full credits in the repository's CREDITS.md). Pokédex data from": "（採 CC BY-NC 4.0 授權，完整署名見專案的 CREDITS.md）。寶可夢圖鑑資料來自",
  ". Pixelify Sans font (OFL). The music and sound effects are original to the project.": "。字型採用 Pixelify Sans（OFL）。音樂與音效由本專案原創製作。",
  "Contact and content removal": "聯絡與內容移除",
  "If you are a rights holder and want something removed, write to us and we'll take it down as soon as possible:": "若你是相關內容的權利人並希望移除素材，請透過以下方式聯絡原作者：",
  "Source code:": "原始碼：",
  "Privacy": "隱私權",
  "If you create an account, we store your player name and your game (collection, coins, upgrades and stats) in Google Firebase so you can continue on any computer. If you sign in with Google, Firebase also stores your Google email to identify you (it is never shown to other players). We don't use your data for anything else, we don't share it, and there are no ads or tracking. As a guest, nothing is stored outside your browser.": "建立帳號後，玩家名稱與遊戲進度會儲存在本站資料庫，以便在不同裝置接續遊玩。登入資料不會向其他玩家公開。訪客模式不會建立伺服器存檔。",
  "Friends and leaderboard: your": "好友與排行榜：你的",
  "is public to other players. We store your friends list, whether you're online and your best times (with your nickname and your Pokémon).": "會向其他玩家公開。本站也會儲存好友名單、上線狀態與最佳成績，成績會附上暱稱及使用的寶可夢。",
  "Group games: your browser connects": "合作遊戲中，瀏覽器會",
  "to your teammates' browsers (like a video call), so each of you may be able to see the others' IP address. Only play in a group with people you know. If a direct connection isn't possible, the game goes through Firebase's servers.": "透過 WebRTC 與隊友建立連線，因此玩家可能看見彼此的 IP。若本站已設定 Cloudflare TURN，無法直連時可透過中繼服務連線。",
  "You can delete your account whenever you want (your nickname, friends and records are deleted too):": "你可以隨時刪除帳號；暱稱、好友關係及排行榜紀錄也會一併刪除：",
  "Delete my account and my game": "刪除我的帳號與遊戲進度",
  "PokéSurvivor needs JavaScript to work. Please enable it to play.": "PokéSurvivor 需要 JavaScript 才能運作，請先啟用後再遊玩。",
  "A free survival fan game with 966 Pokémon from all 9 regions: choose your partner, survive the hordes, evolve your moves, take on legendaries and play co-op with up to 4 friends.": "免費的寶可夢同人生存遊戲，收錄九個地區共 966 隻寶可夢。選擇夥伴、迎戰敵群、進化招式、挑戰傳說寶可夢，也能與好友組成最多四人的隊伍。",
  "Game guide": "遊戲指南",
  "Support": "贊助",
  "Support the project": "贊助原作",
  "Donate on Ko-fi": "透過 Ko-fi 贊助原作者",
  "More info": "了解更多",
  "PokéSurvivor is and will stay": "PokéSurvivor 現在與未來都會",
  "free": "免費提供",
  ", with no ads or purchases. If you'd like to help keep it online, you can make a": "，沒有廣告或內購。如果你願意協助維持原作網站，可以提供",
  "voluntary donation": "自願贊助",
  ": all the money goes to the": "，款項僅用於",
  "servers and the domain": "伺服器與網域費用",
  ", nothing else.": "，不作其他用途。",
  "Donating gives no advantage in the game.": "贊助不會提供任何遊戲優勢。",
  "What it costs to keep it running": "維護費用",
  "Servers (saves, accounts, leaderboards and multiplayer)": "伺服器（存檔、帳號、排行榜與多人連線）",
  "Depends on how many people play": "依實際遊玩人數而定",
  "Domain pokesurvivor.com": "pokesurvivor.com 網域",
  "≈€12 per year": "每年約 12 歐元",
  "The more people play, the more the servers cost. Anything left over is saved for the following months' costs.": "遊玩人數越多，伺服器費用越高。若有餘款，會保留用於之後的維護支出。",
  "Fan game {x}: no ads or purchases. Pokémon and its characters are owned by Nintendo, Creatures and GAME FREAK; this project is not affiliated with them.": "本作為{x}的同人遊戲，沒有廣告或內購。寶可夢及相關角色屬於 Nintendo、Creatures 與 GAME FREAK，本專案與上述公司無關。",
  ": no ads or purchases. Pokémon and its characters are owned by Nintendo, Creatures and GAME FREAK; this project is not affiliated with them.": "，沒有廣告或內購。寶可夢及相關角色屬於 Nintendo、Creatures 與 GAME FREAK，本專案與上述公司無關。",
  ". It has no ads or purchases. You can support it with voluntary donations, which are used only to pay for the servers and the domain and give no advantage in the game.": "。遊戲沒有廣告或內購。你可以自願贊助原作者，款項僅用於原作伺服器與網域費用，不會提供遊戲內優勢。",
