  "You dash at the enemy like lightning and hit everything on the way.": "如閃電般衝向敵人，攻擊路徑上的所有目標。",
  "A short fan of flames that burns.": "朝前方近距離噴出扇形火焰，使敵人灼傷。",
  "Two leaves that fly out and back, cutting both ways.": "射出兩片會飛回身旁的葉子，來回都能造成傷害。",
  "A bolt that jumps from one enemy to the next.": "釋放會在敵人之間跳躍的電流。",
  "You leave pools of poison that badly poison whoever steps on them.": "沿途留下毒池，使踩中的敵人陷入劇毒。",
  "Leaves webs on the ground that trap and greatly slow whoever steps on them.": "在地上留下蛛網，纏住踩中的敵人並大幅減速。",
  "Rocks fall from the sky onto nearby enemies.": "讓岩石從空中落下，砸向附近敵人。",
  "A bone that flies out and back, hitting hard.": "投出會飛回身旁的骨頭，造成強力打擊。",
  "Psychic blades that come back to you.": "射出會返回身旁的精神利刃。",
  "Scatters spikes that burst when stepped on.": "在地上撒下尖刺，敵人踩中時會引爆。",
  "Poison spikes that badly poison when they burst.": "撒下毒刺，爆開時使敵人陷入劇毒。",
  "Hailstones fall on enemies and slow them.": "讓冰雹砸向敵人，造成傷害並使其減速。",
  "Two steel meteors that crush where they land.": "召喚兩顆金屬流星，重擊落點附近的敵人。",
  "Leaves a floating flame that fires on its own and burns.": "留下懸浮火焰，自動攻擊敵人並造成灼傷。",
  "A decoy that stays behind shooting for you.": "留下會自動射擊的替身。",
  "You dive and slash everything you pass through.": "俯衝劃過敵群，攻擊沿途所有敵人。",
