  "Enjoying PokéSurvivor? I make it on my own and the servers cost money. If you'd like, you can help keep it online.": "喜歡 PokéSurvivor 嗎？原作者獨力開發遊戲，也需要負擔伺服器費用。你可以自願贊助，支持原作持續營運。",
  "Support on Ko-fi": "透過 Ko-fi 支持原作者",
