  "New accounts are full for this month: they reopen on {x} 1. If you already have an account, sign in as usual. If not, play as a guest.": "本月的註冊名額已滿，預計 {x} 月 1 日重新開放。已有帳號可照常登入，也可以先以訪客身分遊玩。",
  "There are no new account slots left this month (they reopen on {x} 1). Meanwhile, you can play as a guest.": "本月已無註冊名額，預計 {x} 月 1 日重新開放。這段期間仍可使用訪客模式。",
