  "Type matchups, weather damage, orbit cooldowns and pure damage use separate rules.": "相剋、天氣傷害、軌道冷卻及純粹傷害另計。",
  "Favorites, font and bonuses": "最愛收藏、字型與能力加成",
  "Double-tap to favorite up to 100 Pokémon; use the heart filter to browse them.": "快速點兩下寶可夢即可加入或取消最愛，上限 100 隻；可用左側最愛篩選跨地區查看。",
  "Choose Cubic 11 in Settings and inspect your bonuses during runs and card selection.": "可在設定切換 Cubic 11 像素字型，並在遊戲角落及選卡畫面查看累計能力加成。",
  "The health bar below your character has been moved down slightly to clear attack animations.": "角色下方的血條再向下移動一些，減少與攻擊動畫重疊。",
