  "Reserve: off": "招式儲備：關閉",
  "Do not equip": "不裝備",
  "Equip": "裝備",
  "Continue without a held item.": "維持未裝備道具的狀態。",
  "Golden names and equipment choices": "金色紀念名稱與裝備選擇",
  "Pokémon that survive 30 minutes now have golden names with sparkles.": "存活達 30 分鐘的寶可夢，名稱改為金字、金框與閃光效果。",
  "After buying Repertoire, toggle the second starting move for each Pokémon.": "購買招式儲備後，可為每隻寶可夢切換是否攜帶第二個初始招式。",
  "Your first item also asks whether you want to equip it.": "首次拾取道具時也會詢問是否裝備，不再自動裝備。",
  "Could not change the reserve setting.": "無法變更招式儲備設定，請重新開啟強化頁面再試。",
  "Stronger healers and 3% gacha shinies": "治療者調整與抽卡異色 3%",
  "Healers restore 5–12% based on player level; each target can be healed at most once every 3 seconds.": "治療者依玩家等級回復 5～12%；同一目標每 3 秒最多接受一次治療。",
  "Healers can heal each other and special enemies through walls; they can spawn after one minute, up to 10 at a time.": "治療者可互補、替特殊敵人回血並穿牆治療；開場一分鐘後可生成，場上最多 10 隻。",
  "Gacha shiny chance increases to 3%; star rates and guarantees stay unchanged.": "抽卡異色獨立機率提高至 3%，不改星級機率與保底。",
  "Current cap reached": "目前達減傷上限",
  "Armor fixes and stronger shields": "護甲修正與護盾者調整",
  "Armor, items and temporary effects no longer subtract from each other; total defense reduction including melee is capped at 90%.": "護甲、道具與臨時效果分開計算，避免互相倒扣；含近戰保護的防禦減傷最高 90%。",
  "Shielders grant 10–40% shields based on level, cannot shield themselves, and share a 2.5-second cooldown per target.": "護盾者依玩家等級提供 10～40% 護盾，不能替自己上盾；同一目標每 2.5 秒最多接受一次上盾。",
  "Healers and shielders are capped at 25 each. Cubic 11 is the default font for new settings.": "治療者與護盾者各最多 25 隻；未設定過字型的玩家預設使用 Cubic 11。",
  "The Repertoire toggle is on its own row; after purchase the maximum-level indicator is hidden.": "招式儲備開關改至獨立下一行，購買後不再顯示已達上限與單格進度點。",
  "Commemorative names show clearer golden frames and sparkles in Pokémon selection.": "寶可夢選擇畫面的紀念名稱金框與閃光更清楚，遊戲 HUD 也保留呈現。",
  "Commemorative names keep golden text and sparkles without a frame.": "紀念名稱移除外框與底色，保留金字及閃光。",
  "Golden text without a frame": "金字閃光保留、移除外框",
