  "Charges for a moment and fires a huge beam that pierces everything.": "短暫蓄力後，發射能穿透敵人的巨大光束。",
  "You spin in place, hitting everything around you several times.": "原地連續旋轉，攻擊周圍敵人。",
  "You dash wrapped in flames, burning everything in your path.": "全身包覆火焰向前衝，使路徑上的敵人灼傷。",
  "A whirlpool that drags enemies into its center and keeps damaging them.": "形成漩渦，將敵人拉向中心並持續造成傷害。",
  "A seed that bounces from enemy to enemy.": "投出會在敵人之間彈射的種子。",
  "A ball of energy that chases the enemy.": "發射會追蹤敵人的能量球。",
  "Absorbs light for a moment and releases it as a huge beam.": "短暫吸收光芒後，發射巨大的光束。",
  "A shock marked on the ground that paralyzes whoever it catches.": "在地面預警區釋放電擊，造成傷害並使敵人暫時無法行動。",
  "An electric ball that jumps from enemy to enemy.": "發射會在敵人之間彈射的電球。",
  "A mental wave that damages and pushes away everyone near you.": "釋放精神波，攻擊並擊退附近敵人。",
  "A ball of mist that chases the enemy and slows it down.": "發射會追蹤敵人的霧球，造成傷害並使其減速。",
  "An acid spray that jumps between enemies and poisons them.": "噴出會在敵人之間彈射的酸液，使命中的敵人中毒。",
  "A sand vortex that traps and drags enemies in.": "形成沙漩渦，將敵人拉向中心並持續造成傷害。",
  "The ground bursts in a line in front of you, wave after wave.": "沿前方依序引爆地面，形成連續震波。",
  "A gust of wind that sweeps away everyone near you.": "掀起強風，擊退周圍敵人。",
  "Two blades of air that seek out the enemy.": "射出兩道會追蹤敵人的空氣利刃。",
  "A flash that bounces between enemies.": "發射會在敵人之間彈射的光束。",
  "You dash through the enemies, hitting everyone in your path.": "衝過敵群，攻擊路徑上的所有敵人。",
  "Rocks fall where the ground warns, trapping whoever they catch.": "讓岩石砸向地面預警區，造成傷害並使敵人暫時無法行動。",
  "Ancient rocks that circle around you.": "讓古老岩石環繞身旁，攻擊靠近的敵人。",
  "A gem flash that bounces from enemy to enemy.": "發射會在敵人之間彈射的寶石光束。",
  "Super fast shards that chase the enemy.": "射出高速追蹤敵人的冰礫。",
  "A sudden chill marked on the ground that freezes whoever it catches.": "在地面預警區釋放寒氣，造成傷害並使敵人暫時無法行動。",
  "Spinning kicks that hit everything around you.": "連續使出迴旋踢，攻擊周圍敵人。",
  "A punch into the air that sends out a wave and pushes enemies away.": "揮拳釋放衝擊波，攻擊並擊退附近敵人。",
  "A tremendous punch where the ground warns: it stuns whoever it catches.": "重擊地面預警區內的敵人，造成傷害並使其暈眩。",
  "A shadow that slips along the ground to the enemy.": "讓暗影沿地面追蹤敵人。",
  "A cursed wind that swirls enemies together and keeps damaging them.": "掀起詭異旋風，將敵人捲向中心並持續造成傷害。",
  "A short fan of dragon breath that slows.": "近距離吐出扇形龍息，使敵人減速。",
